{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives forward progress in clear conditions, uses directed one-shot recovery after obstacle events, keeps action states robust to pre-action sensor updates by self-looping on non-critical path_clear, and returns to forward exploration immediately when safe.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in G",
    "Use one policy specification with perception states and one-shot action states to enforce safe progress-oriented behavior"
  ],
